    "2d6a47a2-def5-4409-b2d0-220b76b547a9": {
      "type": "section-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "3271a5fe-c270-4d05-8ca4-2de7169f5805": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Dedicated, trusted guidance",
            "text": "<p>We believe in people, not bots. Stop spending endless hours watching youtube videos. With Homeschool, you’re matched with a certified training team dedicated to you and your pup through your entire journey. </p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "cd0b21bd-407d-473d-9bfb-8f1bf134260d": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Safe for all dogs",
            "text": "<p>Whether your puppy isn't old enough for socialization or you have a dog with a bit of extra personality, virtual training can be a lot <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">less frightening than an unfamiliar environment</span> with unknown people and dogs. By training in your dog’s “safe space”, you are making the process less overwhelming for them (and you!) </p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "2b21a5fa-38d8-4e40-b2dd-867a52b7a2ca": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Guaranteed results",
            "text": "<p>If you are not satisfied with the dog’s progress after the program, we will give you your money back* OR continue to train with you for 4 more weeks free of cost.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        }
      },
