            "text": "<p><strong>Personalized, private 1:1 online training with your dedicated dog expert. Guaranteed results. <br/><br/><br/></strong></p><p>Free Pup Evaluation Call</p><p>Weekly Live 1:1 Sessions (45 min)</p><p>Private Office Hours</p><p>Message-an-Expert</p><p>Dedicated Trainer</p><p>LAY LO™ Product Discounts</p><p>Homeschool Training Guarantee*</p><p>* * * </p><p>Insider Community Access</p><p>20+ Video Course Library Access</p><p><em>*Available for multi-session bundles only</em><br/>                </p>",
            "button_text": "Schedule Your Free Pup Evaluation",
