    "2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is online training?",
            "text": "<p>When training your pup online, we provide the tools and support to help <em>you </em>train your dog completely on your own. Your weekly video calls with your dedicated trainer will assist you in learning the proper techniques to train your dog and better understand them. After each call, we'll provide homework to track your progress along with a video lesson to prep you for your next live training. </p><p></p><p>To watch a sample online lesson, see <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\">here</a> &gt; </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your training philosophy?",
            "text": "<p>We are proud to stand behind positive-reinforcement training practices. All of our trainers are force-free certified experts ensuring that the techniques you learn are promoting a positive lifestyle. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer refunds?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, we couldn't be more committed to your success. Our unique training guarantee gives you the confidence to get started without the risk. In addition to our 7-day free trial, if you're not 100% satisfied with Homeschool, you can choose to get your money back OR continue training, on us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Homeschool for all dogs, shapes, ages and sizes?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! Our premium program offers both puppy foundation and behavior modification classes. Whether you're trying to work through one problem or a few, we will carefully customize a program to meet your needs. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
